<title>
A-Pillar Outer Panel, Front Door Hinge Reinforcement, Dash Side Panel, Dash Side Lower Panel, Front Pillar Upper Extension, Front Pillar Inner Panel and Front Pillar Upper Reinforcement Removal and Installation
</title>
<attention3>
<ptxt>
The figure below shows condition where the following parts are removed.
</ptxt>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Front fender: 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A9A06005"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Front fender bracket, front fender upper front bracket, front fender lower bracket and front fender lower bracket extension: 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A9B06002"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Cowl side outer member: 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A9B06003"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</attention3>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IGSB0A9B0075.jpg" width = "183.000mm" height = "104.891mm" ver = "01" gw = "341" gh = "281"/>
</figure>
<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0A9B06011001">
<title>
General Notes
</title>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Welding method and number of welding points are the same on both sides. This repair instruction shows procedure for left side.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Part filled with foamed material is included in parts of this repair. Therefore, repair referring to 
<intxref refid = "AENLSB0A9B06024">Foamed Material Filling Area Repair</intxref>
 for precautions and repair procedure.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Assistant grip bracket is to be reused.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
The dimensions shown in the figure are reference values when cutting replacement part placed on top of existing part. Determine most appropriate cutting (or joint) line considering both size of replacement part and condition of existing part.
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</servinfosub>
<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0A9B06011002">
<title>
Removal
</title>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Mark at the shown position and cut A-pillar outer panel, front pillar inner panel and front pillar upper reinforcement at the same time at shown rough cutting position.
</ptxt>
<attention4>
<ptxt>
You may accidentally cut the parts under the side sill outer panel when cutting the side sill outer panel.
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
Take sufficient care not to damage the parts under the side sill outer panel when cutting the side sill outer panel.
</ptxt>
</attention4>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Mark at the shown position and cut A-pillar outer panel.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Drill out welding spots.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Bend open metal tab (arrow) and remove A-pillar outer panel.
</ptxt>
