<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A9B06024"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Install front pillar inner panel and front pillar upper reinforcement.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Conduct plug weld.
</ptxt>
